ject, select the correct part to grab.\n7. Grab the box. The more boxes you grab, the more your vision is obstructed.\n8. Avoid obstacles on the floor. Colliding with an obstacle causes you to drop the box you're carrying.\n9. Avoid obstacles and move the box to the green cart.\n10. Move automatically in narrow spaces.\n11. An orange speaker icon appears when you get close to the person ahead.\n12. Check the speaker icon and say, \u201cExcuse me, please move aside.\u201d", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "1. Grab onto the cart.\n2. You can increase speed by holding the center of the cart.\n3. Higher cart speed increases collision risk. The higher the collision risk, the more frequently obstacles appear.\n4. When an obstacle appears, wait until it disappears.\n5. Grabable parts of objects are highlighted.\n6. When grabbing an object, select the correct part to grab.\n7. Grab the box. The more boxes you grab, the more your vision is obstructed.\n8. Avoid obstacles on the floor. Colliding with an obstacle causes you to drop the box you're carrying.\n9. Avoid obstacles and move the box to the green cart.\n10. Move automatically in narrow spaces.\n11. An orange speaker icon appears when you get close to the person ahead.\n12. Check the speaker icon and say, \u201cExcuse me, please move aside.\u201d", "genre_names": ["Learning"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "25916715011273751", "is_approved": false, "is_concept": false, "is_enterprise_enabled": false, "organization": {"id": "", "is_authorized_for_quest": false, "application_groupings": {"count": 0, "nodes": [], "__typename": "", "typename_enum": 0}}, "platform": "", "publisher_name": "ContentsDA Inc.", "required_space_adjusted": 511929962, "requiredSpaceAdjustedFormatted": "488.21 MB", "total_installed_space": 352541316, "totalInstalledSpaceFormatted": "336.21 MB", "quality_rating_aggregate": 0, "img": "", "packageName": "com.ContentsDa.CollisionAccidentPreventionOculus", "imageLink": "/cdn/images/2591671501127